OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA&E did not get the basics right -
OL,4,Amy son's life was ruined at 32
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May 2024, a few months after having
OL,7,Ftreatment for a brain tumour, Oli
OL,8,FCoppock went to Warrington Hospital's
OL,9,Femergency department with bad headaches
OL,10,Fand dizziness.
OL,12,FHe underwent tests and assessments, but
OL,13,Fdid not have a brain scan, before going
OL,14,Fhome. It was a decision that ultimately
OL,15,Fruined his life at the age of 32, his
OL,16,Ffamily says. A week later, with fluid
OL,17,Fbuilding up on the brain, he suffered a
OL,18,Fcardiac arrest. He did not recover and
OL,19,Fnow lives in almost complete paralysis.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1788852334
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA&E did not get the basics right -
OL,4,Amy son's life was ruined at 32
OL,5,
OL,6,FOli's case is just one of a growing
OL,7,Fnumber of clinical negligence claims
OL,8,Fbeing made in England relating to A&E
OL,9,Fcare. An analysis by the BBC shows
OL,10,Fthere has been a 41% rise in cases over
OL,11,Fthe past five years, with doctors
OL,12,Flinking it to the long delays and
OL,13,Fpressures being seen in emergency
OL,14,Fdepartments.
OL,16,FOli's father, Stephen, says he knows
OL,17,FA&E staff are under pressure, but he
OL,18,Fcannot understand how a brain scan was
OL,19,Fnot ordered, given his son's medical
OL,20,Fhistory.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
